WEBVTT

00:16:27.109 --> 00:16:30.633
So now, when a student
raises his or her hand,

00:16:30.657 --> 00:16:33.053
unlike in a normal classroom,

00:16:33.077 --> 00:16:35.847
the teacher would not know
who the student is.

00:16:35.871 --> 00:16:39.152
So something would pop up
on top of the student's head

00:16:39.176 --> 00:16:41.626
and say the name of the student,

00:16:41.650 --> 00:16:43.188
how they did in the class.

00:16:43.212 --> 00:16:45.251
CA: How recently
they went to the bathroom.

00:16:45.275 --> 00:16:46.934
KFL: If you want to know, yeah.

00:16:46.958 --> 00:16:50.562
So this helps the teacher
teach a much bigger classroom

00:16:50.586 --> 00:16:55.508
and bring education to the countryside
and the poorer villages, even.

00:16:55.935 --> 00:16:57.903
On top of all this,

00:16:57.927 --> 00:17:02.724
the Chinese education system
now incorporates